00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:25.460
But still, for a million
row data set-- a million

00:12:25.460 --> 00:12:29.300
plus row data set-- with
significant complexity,

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:33.590
one hour of training by
AutoML Tables gets you here.

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:35.660
one hour of training.

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:38.090
And oh, by the way, as
